{"pageid":4552,"title":"Vampires","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Vampires</span>","revid":20079,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-Character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Vampire</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"appearsin\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Appears in</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Blood Moon</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Vampire</b> is an enemy that spawns during a <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">Blood Moon</a>. When killed, it drops 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone,</a> 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Meat_Vinyl_Player\" title=\"Meat Vinyl Player\">Meat Vindyl Player</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Stake\" title=\"Wooden Stake\">Stake</a>\n</p><p>It can spawn in the center of the Farlands (near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>), the Taiga (behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's Autologistics</a>) and in the Savannah.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163722\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 56/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 82/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnst